        {
          "text": "Asilikali ŵawo ŵa ngondo ŵala ŵawulajidwe ni upanga uwakopwece mkamwa mwa jwele juŵakwesile pa haci jula; nipo yijuni yosope yalile ni kwikuta mnowu wa ŵandu ŵala.",
